---
mm: 1.2
kind: test
name: target-mcu-provider
option: buildable-host no
use: mm.mcu
unit: tests/target/mcu-provider/main.cpp
---

# target MCU provider

Compile and link proof for platform-provider injection in the test tool. The
test names only mm.mcu. A selected target platform must supply the provider, and
external link ownership must carry that provider through the same CMake bridge
used for applications.

It has no requires-board declaration because the interface binding, rather than
one board name, determines availability. It is compile-only on platforms with
no configured runner.
